the guest, seen as its held init.sock connection: gone at process death
the VMM process: gone at process death
its scratch file: gone at process death
its network namespace: gone at process death
its host-side veth, and so the tap beside it: gone at process death
its cgroup: gone at process death
its rootfs layer: gone at process death
the container record: gone at container removal
init.sock: still present after container removal
